OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA grey start with low cloud and
OL,6,Fpatchy mist for many areas. Cloud
OL,7,Fslowly clears through the morning,
OL,8,Fwith a few brighter spells developing.
OL,9,FCloud returns from the northwest with
OL,10,Flight rain by late afternoon. Feeling
OL,11,Fwarm in sunny spells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CTonight:FThe rain clears through the
OL,14,Fevening with cloud breaking overnight
OL,15,Fto give clear spells into Saturday
OL,16,Fmorning. Colder than last night with
OL,17,Fmist and fog patches developing by
OL,18,Fdawn.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
