OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CSaturday:FA cool start wtih any
OL,6,Fovernight mist and fog patchs clearing
OL,7,Fto a fine, partly cloudy and dry day.
OL,8,FFeeling warm in the sunshine with
OL,9,Flight winds. Cold again overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Sunday to Tuesday:FAfter a
OL,12,Ffine, if breezy, morning, rain moves
OL,13,Fthrough late on Sunday. A pleasant day
OL,14,Fon Monday before an increasingly wet
OL,15,Fand windy day on Tuesday. Temperatures
OL,16,Fnear average.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
